      "content": "thanks for the list. i was a bit surprised about brick lane and canning town being sketchy though... aren't those just parts of the east end with lots of different cultures? what makes them feel unsafe compared to somewhere like south ken or chelsea? is it just the crime stats or is there a certain vibe to those neighborhoods that feels off for a solo traveler?",
